    <!-- A page's own dialogs (PUI-27, PUI-28) on the native prompt sheet (PageDialogSheet.kt, the words read
         through PageDialogWords; PageDialogsTest pins them to Chrome's). Chrome's lines: the title names the
         frame's site (IDS_JAVASCRIPT_MESSAGEBOX_TITLE, …_IFRAME for a frame of another origin), or none for a
         file, data: or about: document (…_NONSTANDARD_URL, …_NONSTANDARD_URL_IFRAME for a frame of an opaque
         origin); the checkbox from the page's second dialog of a visit (…_SUPPRESS_OPTION); the beforeunload
         question (IDS_BEFOREUNLOAD_MESSAGEBOX_*, IDS_BEFORERELOAD_MESSAGEBOX_* for a reload). -->
